<p>Imprisons all sleeping targets within range in their dream state, effectively extending sleeping effects for as long as Dream Prison is maintainted.</p><p>This powerful effect constantly drains <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5.41%, 4.31%, 3.65%, 3.20%, 2.87%</acronym> of your maximum Psi (excluding this talent) per turn, and is considered a psionic channel; as such it will break if you move.</p><p>(Note that sleeping effects that happen each turn, such as Nightmare's damage and Sleep's contagion, will cease to function for the duration of the effect.)</p>